            "line": 357,
            "text": "theorem profile_ode {a z : ℝ} (ha : 1 < a) (hz : 0 < z) :\n    z ^ 2 * iteratedDeriv 2 (profile a) z + (1 + 2 * a * z) * deriv (profile a) z +\n      a * (a - 1) * profile a z = 0"
